    <node id="&quot;小红&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">
小红 is a person actively engaged in mathematical and programming-related problem-solving, often requiring external assistance to address complex constructions and definitions. She is a student known for defining specialized concepts and working on transforming given structures into these defined forms with minimal operations.  

小红 is credited with defining the concept of a "good array," which is characterized by specific conditions related to palindromes. Her task involves counting how many length-k subarrays within a given array qualify as "good arrays." Additionally, she has defined other specialized array types, such as a "双生数组" (twin array), which involves transforming given arrays into this type with the least number of operations.  

Beyond arrays, 小红 is also associated with problems involving matrices. She has defined what constitutes a "good matrix" and is focused on transforming given matrices—such as a 01 matrix—into this special form through operations like adjacent swaps. Her efforts also extend to constructing determinants and permutations, including a 3x3 determinant where each element's absolute value is at least 1 and the determinant's value equals a given variable x, as well as permutations of length n with elements confined to specified ranges.  

小红 is defined as the main character in the problem statement, where she defines the criteria for a "good matrix" and has a matrix that needs to be transformed. She is often mentioned as the person who defines the "good matrix" and performs operations on a 01 matrix by swapping adjacent characters to achieve the desired form. These descriptions highlight 小红's deep involvement in academic or competitive programming challenges, where she consistently defines and works on transforming mathematical structures to meet specific criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is an individual trying to transform a binary matrix into a "好矩阵" (good matrix) through a series of adjacent swaps."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is another person asking for help to solve a problem involving binary numbers a, b, and c."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is asking for help to determine the minimum cost to make a XOR b equal to c."&lt;SEP&gt;"A person who was judged by 小L to calculate the minimum cost to make a \oplus b=c."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is a person who needs to be assisted in determining the minimum cost to make a XOR b equal to c through a series of operations."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-934cc7b3a877cbd7ad4ae67d1ccb33c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ac191ac64f16e456c655d4b8863811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb93b3d8dd3d7a52c8db5aa7be12e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d855de4fc3c8066acae7529422e672d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0c9c6802989382170739955a5bae46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29266653556f4758c4fbea2541c63207&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8103be36cfb2447eeee275964beaf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47baadad1b80a9eb7ea15b9cd824968b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb70ce68f01832942dce770ad4d1320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99c195bf139756748ff95a63861cbef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad8afc7ac300d86b72e962805041fa5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-504efc1d29aab22b90705499f57173fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-466772e1ad2cb9b8fdd70bf09c71858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbee70be3b8011ff77829977d78f0058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8af7cfb62173340e7ef202c51be3c0d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c926060a3af4a149ab3816fc63a59e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7230c75a37c25448800f6f28d89050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de530eec1b33d2199269b22b88bb1c32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8796025571904280b91872c5eb3f6610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3f9d595e0b4dc6b94e1564563f7ded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72507ce11e78cbb0f5fe85180ed22a32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7907aaf6e77e8266bb40e1c8a136bf60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb726f40228a938cab23f8ee251f3349&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58fc77dbcd0a97d49a184217f891dcb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bbc06444b81cde07bd3f70e96886225</data>
