    <node id="&quot;牛可乐&quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2da9ecfa854ec125c90cf41bc3e549e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31863a3502540c31035499a1b63c97c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79af8c07e093eeaf2a8b54738698e7af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ae2ff0e583348ae265216d143270fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bcd1771d7e55d80f714bbc3d88370bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae077aa7a5a85409843a4ac34869acd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8571d78ef0982dfe0d6ef86e585cbe98</data>
      <data key="d1">"牛可乐 is a name mentioned in the text related to defining the '可爱度' (cute degree) of a string."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is a person who defines a term called 'cute degree' for a string s, and represents someone who poses a problem to others."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is a person who has a matrix of bricks arranged in an n x m matrix and is trying to separate a 'blue maximal connected block' by calculating the minimum number of gray bricks that need to be broken."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 owns and works with the n×m brick matrix arranged in n rows and m columns."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is the creator who defined the concept of 'lovable degree' for strings in the problem description."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is described as defining string s's cuteness and providing a problem about finding a string t with specific properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is the apparent creator or source of the programming problem mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is an individual who defined the concept of a string's '可爱度' (lovable degree) as the largest integer k satisfying certain conditions involving continuous substrings and non-continuous subsequences."</data>
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
    </node>
