      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tokitsukaze is a character sitting on a dragon, capable of using the 'Dragon's Breath' ability to defeat monsters on a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who is riding a dragon and using 'Dragon's Breath' to defeat monsters in a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who sits on a dragon and uses the dragon's breath ability to defeat monsters on a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a character who sits on a dragon and uses 'Dragon's Breath' to defeat monsters in a grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person who has a sequence of integers and wants to find the expected value of the sequence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person who has a sequence of integers and is interested in calculating the expected value of a sequence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tokitsukaze is a person who has a sequence of integers and wants to find the expected value of a specific sequence property."</data>
