      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dragon's Breath is a special ability used by Tokitsukaze through her dragon to defeat monsters in an 'X' shape pattern on the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an ability used by Tokitsukaze's dragon that releases fire in an 'X' shape to defeat monsters on the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an event or action where the dragon releases fire in an 'X' shape to defeat monsters on the grid map."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an event where Tokitsukaze uses the dragon to release fire in an 'X' shape, defeating monsters in specific coordinates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is the ability used by Tokitsukaze and the Dragon to defeat monsters in a specific 'X' shape pattern on the grid map."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea</data>
