      <data key="d1">"A person who teached XiaoL the knowledge of bit operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is a person who recently taught two new operations to 小L."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 recently taught xiao L two new operations: square and square root."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is a person who taught about bit operation knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is a person who taught 小L about bit operation knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is a person who taught Little L about bit operation knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is a person who is teaching 小L about bitwise operation knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the other player in the tic-tac-toe game, who is confident enough to give X privileges."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the second player in the Tic-Tac-Toe game, using 'O' as their symbol for placing marks on the board. They are described as being somewhat arrogant enough to grant 小L a special advantage."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is a person who is playing tic-tac-toe with 小L and generously granted 小L the privilege of taking two consecutive steps."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is a person who is playing tic-tac-toe with 小L and has given 小L the privilege to take two consecutive steps."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is another player in the tic-tac-toe game, who is overconfident and grants the privilege to 小L."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the other player in the Tic-Tac-Toe game, using the mark 'O'."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is another player in the tic-tac-toe game, using the symbol 'O' and being confident enough to grant 小L a privilege."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is the other player in the tic-tac-toe game, who is described as arrogant for giving special privileges to 小L."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is a person playing tic-tac-toe with 小L, giving 小L the privilege to move twice in a row at some point."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-877df4ea12833328944aec827f97328b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d2">chunk-c5eb1d8406f1c61b5ad1590b8396b2ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8674c89c2bbd80ac2ed7bf4f4ece7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41bb705f581ef523c90424ea77cfe827&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9096db2ee9b817fdd4447c67ca4e24c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea15e123e23c10fb0dd1d2aa46c0de25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-054c255dec239c2762b373ecc1e4a1e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e</data>
      <data key="d1">
小L is a person who is primarily engaged in two distinct activities: learning about bit operations and playing tic-tac-toe (井字棋). In the context of learning, 小L is a student under the guidance of 炸鸡, who taught them about bitwise operations. 小L has three binary numbers—specifically a, b, and c, each with n bits—and is focused on understanding bit operations from their instructor, 炸鸡, establishing a clear teacher-student relationship. 

In the context of gaming, 小L is one of the two players participating in a game of tic-tac-toe, referred to as a beginner or novice. They use the symbol 'X' to represent their moves on a 3x3 board. 小L has been granted a special privilege that allows them to take two consecutive steps or moves at some point during the game, distinguishing their role from typical tic-tac-toe gameplay. As a player, they are actively involved in the game and are about to make a move, further emphasizing their participation in this activity. 

Despite the two separate contexts, both descriptions collectively paint a picture of 小L as a multifaceted individual who is both a learner in technical skills and an active, albeit beginner, player in a strategic game.&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a person playing tic-tac-toe, also known as井字棋, and is currently the player to move."</data>
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
    </node>
