      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 3x3 grid where the tic-tac-toe game is being played, with cells marked either X, O, or empty."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 3x3 grid where the tic-tac-toe game is played, with cells marked as 'X', 'O', or 'G' (empty)."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 (board) is the 3x3 grid where the Tic-Tac-Toe game is played, with positions that can be empty (G), contain a smallL's piece (X), or contain a 炸鸡's piece (O)."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 is a 3x3 grid where the game of tic-tac-toe is played, with status cells of 'X', 'O', or 'G'."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 is the grid or board where the game of 井字棋 is played, consisting of 3x3 cells."&lt;SEP&gt;"棋盘 is the 3x3 grid used in the 井字棋 game where 小L and 炸鸡 place their markers, either X or O."</data>
