      <data key="d4">"小红 has an array that she plans to manipulate through the operation of multiplying selected elements by 2."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 introduced the specific properties that define a 'good array' in the context of the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is presented with an array and aims to convert it into a '双生数组,' showing her relationship to the data structure involved in the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 works with the given 数组 and wants to transform it into a 双生数组."&lt;SEP&gt;小红 works with arrays as the primary data structure in the problem.&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is trying to transform the given array into a '双生数组' through operations."</data>
